&_nc_oc=Adr8BeYwgLDhpXU8f-qckMR7foT83nUVmuFQhVYz3WJVAZaHCOXFFyS4Y_UCnVcqS-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9CBigQnCkIsxC4bCjrvK-ldjoGlwVj1nI59-yQMh8cA&oe=6AEC9DBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yjBXFqCSsGIQ7kNvwEYNRFL&_nc_oc=AdrTPGhr_cSp1ScfTBKS0lIRG7xpdEPP_9DbF6JF2XWMcuuBy3VkWgFrgiEcOQNH4r8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLm5K4Q8USkaM5KRucXcTTN-q9qxwqd9snnHG47mhUDA&oe=6AECAEBC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HD3noZPrE-gQ7kNvwG4yxVZ&_nc_oc=AdocQtQqChQ0h5__nnGFOZSb3TZS3c10UOAUQmmDrBDLJ03FbNNbaQ3MSLLtlaNWQ7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS47y_-wQR59lhV0p_T8LUmHulChmrc32lwvGW8akNJ6g&oe=6AEC9507"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5QI6YfZ8QDYQ7kNvwGDOFCx&_nc_oc=AdqU8tZQwSEgqLr3ffV0GZxH8_e01WAKe0-xnvYXhHehQZxFtO6-mgG91vL-DX7xeOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdQD8o9BeRjGXkLZMxfy5JPJqghgO04UTiCy0a_vJGGg&oe=6AECB915"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sQojeLeksSUQ7kNvwFVuP5C&_nc_oc=Adph9RtjfH4W9jojnSTq3tXoyZmScyc70UL8VtykzNo8QLpKDgDcCNEL7Sp177EU3f0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIyaBJRuNoM8RuE5eBB6F4YbM1dx0Jq4NbyCHB0dY4Xg&oe=6AEC8D64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.